    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44789" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔπλαστ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to mould</i> or
				<i>put into shape</i>, of a broken nose, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				39
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσει ποὺς εὔ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>easy to mould, ductile</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπλαστότερον κηροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					588d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.75
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσις</span> (of sea-water) <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				761a34
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					666c
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); of men, <i>impressionable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1455a33
			</span></i>.</div>
